   "title": "The second fire report",
   "slug": "the-second-fire-report",
   "category": "wagstaffs-yard",
   "image": "archive.jpg",
   "excerpt": "Eight days after the fire, an investigator from Leeds wrote a report the jury never saw. Brian Oduya reads it with us.",
   "date": "2026-09-24",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-file-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-file-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Case file</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Case</strong> Wagstaff’s Yard</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Part</strong> 4 of 6</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Released</strong> Thursday 24 September 2026</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Length</strong> 48 minutes</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:audio -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg\"></audio><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Stand-in audio: a LibriVox reading from “An Account of the Proceedings on the Trial of Susan B. Anthony” (CC0, Wikimedia Commons). Replace with your episode file.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:audio -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-warning\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-warning\"><strong>Content warning</strong> This episode describes how Arthur Kell died, without detail.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Chapters</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"is-style-chapters\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list is-style-chapters\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=0\">00:00</a> Previously</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=215\">03:35</a> Box 14</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=870\">14:30</a> Brian reads the report</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=1640\">27:20</a> What “point of origin” means</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=2310\">38:30</a> Why the jury never saw it</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=2740\">45:40</a> Janet hears it for the first time</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"className\":\"is-style-board\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group is-style-board\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"large\",\"fontFamily\":\"display\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"textTransform\":\"uppercase\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size has-display-font-family\">Non-disclosure</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">When the prosecution holds material that could help the defence and doesn’t hand it over.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sources</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"className\":\"is-style-sources\"} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list is-style-sources\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>West Yorkshire Fire Service, investigation report, 19 March 1994. Hull History Centre, ref. C DPF/4/14.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Interview with Brian Oduya, recorded in Leeds on 3 July 2026.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>R v Pryce trial transcript, day 3, pages 41 to 58.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Transcript</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:details -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details\"><summary>Read the transcript</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Maren</strong> The box is labelled “Wagstaff’s, misc.” Nobody has signed it out since 1996.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Brian</strong> Misc. That’s where things go when nobody wants to decide about them.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Brian</strong> “The seat of the fire is not consistent with the account given.” That’s a sentence you notice.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-x-small-font-size\">Typed by Dev and checked against the audio.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">If this episode affected you</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Samaritans: 116 123, any time. Victim Support: 08 08 16 89 111.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "The witness on Hedon Road",
   "slug": "the-witness-on-hedon-road",
   "category": "wagstaffs-yard",
   "image": "road.jpg",
   "excerpt": "One man said he saw Lee Pryce walking away from the docks at ten past one. We read his statement, with the police redactions still in.",
   "date": "2026-09-17",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-file-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-file-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Case file</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Case</strong> Wagstaff’s Yard</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Part</strong> 3 of 6</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Released</strong> Thursday 17 September 2026</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Length</strong> 51 minutes</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:audio -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg\"></audio><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Stand-in audio: a LibriVox reading from “An Account of the Proceedings on the Trial of Susan B. Anthony” (CC0, Wikimedia Commons). Replace with your episode file.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:audio -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Chapters</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"is-style-chapters\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list is-style-chapters\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=0\">00:00</a> Previously</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=300\">05:00</a> The statement</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=1150\">19:10</a> Street lights on Hedon Road in 1994</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=2000\">33:20</a> The witness today</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=2700\">45:00</a> Lee listens back</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote {\"className\":\"is-style-redacted\"} -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-style-redacted\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">I saw a lad on Hedon Road at about ten past one. He had a <strong>green</strong> jacket on and he was walking fast towards <strong>Marfleet Lane</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Witness statement, 2 June 1994, as released</cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sources</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"className\":\"is-style-sources\"} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list is-style-sources\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Witness statement, 2 June 1994, released with redactions in 2024.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Hull City Council street lighting records, 1993 to 1995.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Transcript</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:details -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details\"><summary>Read the transcript</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Maren</strong> He asked us not to use his name, and we won’t. He still lives about a mile from the dock.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-x-small-font-size\">Typed by Dev and checked against the audio.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">If this episode affected you</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Samaritans: 116 123, any time. Victim Support: 08 08 16 89 111.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "Lee",
   "slug": "lee",
   "category": "wagstaffs-yard",
   "image": "station.jpg",
   "excerpt": "Lee Pryce was 22 when he was arrested. He is 54 now. He talks to us for the first time about the interview room.",
   "date": "2026-09-10",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-file-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-file-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Case file</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Case</strong> Wagstaff’s Yard</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Part</strong> 2 of 6</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Released</strong> Thursday 10 September 2026</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Length</strong> 57 minutes</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:audio -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg\"></audio><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Stand-in audio: a LibriVox reading from “An Account of the Proceedings on the Trial of Susan B. Anthony” (CC0, Wikimedia Commons). Replace with your episode file.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:audio -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-warning\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-warning\"><strong>Content warning</strong> Discussion of a suicide attempt in prison (31:20 to 34:05).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Chapters</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"is-style-chapters\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list is-style-chapters\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=0\">00:00</a> Previously</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=240\">04:00</a> Meeting Lee in Goole</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=1100\">18:20</a> The interview, 2 June 1994</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=1880\">31:20</a> Prison, briefly</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=2600\">43:20</a> What he wants now</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sources</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"className\":\"is-style-sources\"} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list is-style-sources\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Police interview record, 2 June 1994, obtained by Lee’s solicitor.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Interviews with Lee Pryce, recorded April to June 2026.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Transcript</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:details -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details\"><summary>Read the transcript</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Lee</strong> I said I was at my mam’s. My mam said I was at my mam’s. That was it, that was my alibi, and it wasn’t enough.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-x-small-font-size\">Typed by Dev and checked against the audio.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">If this episode affected you</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Samaritans: 116 123, any time. Victim Support: 08 08 16 89 111.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "The night of 11 March 1994",
   "slug": "the-night-of-11-march-1994",
   "category": "wagstaffs-yard",
   "image": "docks.jpg",
   "excerpt": "Start here. Arthur Kell’s daughter Janet tells us about her dad, and about the night the yard burned.",
   "date": "2026-09-03",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-file-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-file-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Case file</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Case</strong> Wagstaff’s Yard</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Part</strong> 1 of 6</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Released</strong> Thursday 3 September 2026</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Length</strong> 45 minutes</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:audio -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg\"></audio><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Stand-in audio: a LibriVox reading from “An Account of the Proceedings on the Trial of Susan B. Anthony” (CC0, Wikimedia Commons). Replace with your episode file.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:audio -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-warning\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-warning\"><strong>Content warning</strong> Discussion of a death in a fire.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Chapters</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"is-style-chapters\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list is-style-chapters\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=0\">00:00</a> Janet’s letter</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=420\">07:00</a> Arthur</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=1300\">21:40</a> The yard</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=2010\">33:30</a> The phone call at 3am</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=2500\">41:40</a> Why now</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sources</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"className\":\"is-style-sources\"} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list is-style-sources\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Letter from Janet Kell to the show, May 2025.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Hull evening paper, 12 March 1994.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Transcript</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:details -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details\"><summary>Read the transcript</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Janet</strong> He used to bring me the offcuts. I had a doll’s house made of Wagstaff’s timber.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-x-small-font-size\">Typed by Dev and checked against the audio.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">If this episode affected you</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Samaritans: 116 123, any time. Victim Support: 08 08 16 89 111.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "A correction to part 3",
   "slug": "a-correction-to-part-3",
   "category": "updates",
   "image": "newspaper.jpg",
   "excerpt": "We got a date wrong in part 3. Here is what we said, what is right, and what we changed.",
   "date": "2026-09-25",
   "template": "single-update",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">In part 3 we said the second fire report was dated 14 March 1994. It is dated 19 March. Maren read the date off a photocopy with a stamp over it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">It matters because on 14 March the police had not yet named anyone. By 19 March they had. The report was written after Lee Pryce became a suspect, and it still said the fire did not start where the police thought it did.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">We have re-edited part 3 at 22:14 and corrected the transcript. The change is in the <a href=\"/sources-and-corrections/\">corrections log</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Thanks to Janet Kell, who checked the stamp with a magnifying glass.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "Carol",
   "slug": "carol",
   "category": "the-ferry-inn",
   "image": "phonebox.jpg",
   "excerpt": "The last part of season 1. Carol’s brother Mark reads the letter he wrote to her in 2017.",
   "date": "2026-01-12",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-file-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-file-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Case file</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Case</strong> The Ferry Inn</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Part</strong> 5 of 5</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Released</strong> Monday 12 January 2026</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Length</strong> 43 minutes</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:audio -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg\"></audio><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Stand-in audio: a LibriVox reading from “An Account of the Proceedings on the Trial of Susan B. Anthony” (CC0, Wikimedia Commons). Replace with your episode file.</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:audio -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"is-style-warning\"} -->\n<p class=\"is-style-warning\"><strong>Content warning</strong> Discussion of a missing person and of grief.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Chapters</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"is-style-chapters\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list is-style-chapters\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=0\">00:00</a> Previously</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=500\">08:20</a> What the police told Mark in 2024</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=1500\">25:00</a> The letter</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Trialofsusanbanthony_18_anonymous_128kb.ogg#t=2200\">36:40</a> What we still don’t know</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sources</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true,\"className\":\"is-style-sources\"} -->\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list is-style-sources\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Humberside Police, letter to the Denby family, March 2024.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Interview with Mark Denby, recorded in Hessle, October 2025.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Transcript</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:details -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details\"><summary>Read the transcript</summary><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Mark</strong> She’d be 67. I keep doing that sum.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"x-small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-x-small-font-size\">Typed by Dev and checked against the audio.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">If this episode affected you</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">Samaritans: 116 123, any time. Victim Support: 08 08 16 89 111.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
  },
